tnorm {"detect": "is.infinite(a) && mean((x - mean(x))^2) >= (b - mean(x))^2", "model": "exp", "status": "ReflectedExponentialBoundary", "when": "$\\mathrm{sd} \\to \\infty$ and $\\mathrm{mean}/\\mathrm{sd}^2 \\to 1/(b - \\bar x)$, with $a = -\\infty$ and $b$ finite: the law of $b - Y$, $Y$ exponential"}
